{"title": "Alert", "pageid": 8367, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Alert", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters", "Applies to Wild Shape"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Threat.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Generic_Threat.webp/300px-Generic_Threat.webp, /w/images/4/4f/Generic_Threat.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Generic_Threat.webp/300px-Generic_Threat.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Generic_Threat.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Alert</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>. It gives you a bonus to your initiative and you can no longer be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Surprised_(Condition)\" title=\"Surprised (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Surprised\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Surprised_(Condition)\" title=\"Surprised (Condition)\">Surprised</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain +5 to <a href=\"/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a> and can no longer be surprised. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">Auntie Ethel</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bernard\" title=\"Bernard\">Bernard</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Bloodfang\" title=\"Bloodfang\">Bloodfang</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador_Szarr\" title=\"Cazador Szarr\">Cazador Szarr</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cloaker\" title=\"Cloaker\">Cloaker</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Cursed_Imp\" title=\"Cursed Imp\">Cursed Imp</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Elminster\" title=\"Elminster\">Elminster</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Gerringothe Thorm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ghislev\" title=\"Ghislev\">Ghislev</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hyena\" title=\"Hyena\">Hyena</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Kar%27niss\" title=\"Kar'niss\">Kar'niss</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\">Nine-Fingers Keene</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Phantasm\" title=\"Phantasm\">Phantasm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pol\" title=\"Pol\">Pol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pollo_the_Muscle\" title=\"Pollo the Muscle\">Pollo the Muscle</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris\" title=\"Ptaris\">Ptaris</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Roah_Moonglow\" title=\"Roah Moonglow\">Roah Moonglow</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Whitemist\" title=\"Whitemist\">Whitemist</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Yurgir\" title=\"Yurgir\">Yurgir</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Granted as a <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> earned at level 4, 8, or 12.</li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">+5 to <a href=\"/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">initiative</a> and cannot be <a href=\"/wiki/Surprised\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprised\">surprised</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195727\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 726/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4193/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2322/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1393/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643642/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.057      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   38.057      1 -total\n 56.28%   21.417      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 50.64%   19.274      1 Template:PageSeo\n 36.89%   14.040      1 Template:Cond\n 23.33%    8.878      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 22.31%    8.492      1 Template:Icon_link\n 21.47%    8.170      1 Template:Icon_text\n 18.80%    7.154      2 Template:Trim\n 16.46%    6.265      1 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:8367-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195727 and revision id 376728. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}